  "details": "I made a post about all the profile changes I think should be done and my feedback here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-the-new-social-menu-ui-feedback-and-suggestions\n\nThe main point of this request is to reduce the verticality problem of the current profile menu. By moving the badges, the groups tab would be visible when you check someone's profile. ( Related post, to keep it consistent when checking your own profile: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-current-avatar-shouldnt-be-displayed-in-the-local-profile )\n\nEdit showing one potential version of this change.",
